				{
					"type": "TextTutorial",
					"properties": {
						"text": "[color=#ffff00][b]Welcome to Draw the Line![/b][/color]\n\n[color=#ffff00][b]Objective[/b][/color]\nThe [icon=ball] is always pulled down by gravity. Draw lines to avoid obstacles ([icon=obstacle][icon=rotor][icon=circle]) and guide it safely to [icon=goal].\n\n[color=#ffff00][b]How to play[/b][/color]\nTouch and drag to draw lines. Each line uses part of your Drawing Meter ([icon=drawing]).\n\nWhen you're ready, tap [icon=run] to start the physics simulation.\n\nIf it doesn't work, tap [icon=reset] and try a new path.\n\n[color=#ffff00][b]Tips[/b][/color]\nSome objects affect the [icon=ball] when touched:\n\n- [icon=booster] pushes the ball in its facing direction.\n- [icon=gravity] flips gravity for the whole level.\n\n[color=#ffff00][b]Tap anywhere[/b][/color] to start.",
